@startuml RF8_Classes
title RF8 — Visualizar esquemas e peças de outros usuários na aba Buscar\nDiagrama de classes — SearchService, filtros, visibilidade, HypeScore v2 público e insights FEED/SEARCH
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E4DEF0
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods

package "fai-domain · model" {
  class User <<table users>> {
    +username: String
    +displayName: String
    +profileType: ProfileType
    +profileVisibility: Visibility
    +status: AccountStatus
    +country: String
  }
  class Scheme <<table schemes>> {
    +title: String
    +style: String
    +occasion: String
    +visibility: Visibility
    +status: SchemeStatus
    +communityIndexed: boolean
    +publishedAt: Instant
    +likeCount: long
    +viewCount: long
  }
  class SchemeItem <<table scheme_items>> {
    +slot: SchemeSlot
    +sortOrder: int
    +snapshotJson: String
  }
  class WardrobeItem <<table wardrobe_items>> {
    +name: String
    +category: String
    +color: String
    +brandName: String
    +styleTags: String
    +occasionTags: String
    +visibility: Visibility
    +moderationStatus: ModerationStatus
    +viewCount: long
  }
  class Follow <<table follows>> {
    +status: FollowStatus
    +respondedAt: Instant
  }
  class StyleDna <<table style_dna>> {
    +styleKeywords: String
  }
  class Share <<table shares>> {
    +channel: ShareChannel
    +caption: String
  }
  class HypeScoreCurrent <<table hype_scores>> {
    +entityType: HypeEntityType
    +entityId: UUID
    +status: HypeStatus
    +score: BigDecimal
    +level: HypeLevel
    +deltaPoints: BigDecimal
    +momentum: HypeMomentum
    +publicEligible: boolean
    +calculatedAt: Instant
  }
}

package "fai-domain · enums" {
  enum SchemeStatus {
    DRAFT
    PUBLISHED
    ARCHIVED
  }
  enum Visibility {
    PRIVATE
    FOLLOWERS
    PUBLIC
  }
  enum FollowStatus {
    PENDENTE
    ACEITO
    BLOQUEADO
  }
  enum ModerationStatus {
    PENDING
    APPROVED
    REJECTED_POLICY
    REJECTED_NOT_CLOTHING
  }
  enum HypeLevel {
    LOW_SIGNAL
    NICHE
    RELEVANT
    HOT
    TRENDING
    VIRAL
  }
}

package "fai-application · service" {
  class SearchService {
    {static} +TABS = LOOKS, PECAS, PESSOAS, MARCAS, CELEBRIDADES
    {static} ~NEUTRAL_HYPE = 0.5
    {static} ~TRENDING_POOL = 30
    +communityFeed(viewer, cursor, size, Filters): Map
    +runway(viewer, cursor, size): Map
    +search(viewer, term, tab, Filters, size, cursor): Map
    +publicPieces(viewer, Filters, cursor, size): Map
    ~visible(viewer, scheme|piece, blocked): boolean
    {static} ~relevance(scheme, items, dnaStyles, publicHype): double
    {static} ~meetsLevel(current, minLevel, config): boolean
    {static} ~publicRow(current): HypeScoreCurrent
    ~trending(viewer, blocked): List<SchemeView>
    ~alternatives(term): List<String>
  }
  class "SearchService.Filters" as Filters <<record>> {
    +style: String
    +occasion: String
    +color: String
    +brand: String
    +category: String
    +hypeLevel: String
    ~chips(): List<Map>
  }
  class "SearchService.Cursor" as Cursor <<record>> {
    +at: Instant
    +id: UUID
    {static} ~parse(raw): Cursor
    ~encode(): String
  }
  class SchemeService {
    +canView(viewer, scheme): boolean
    +requireView(viewer, scheme)
    {static} +moreRestrictive(a, b): Visibility
    +get(viewer, id): Map
    +view(viewer, scheme, items): SchemeView
  }
  class Guard {
    +canView(viewer, ownerId, visibility): boolean
    +blocked(a, b): boolean
    +deny(user, resource, message): ApiException
  }
}

package "fai-application · insights" {
  enum InsightContext {
    FEED
    SEARCH
    EXPLORER_TRENDING
    CREATOR_PROFILE
    .. (públicos e pessoais) ..
    +isPublic(): boolean
  }
  class InsightService {
    {static} ~MAX_ITEMS = 5
    +insights(viewer, context, window, region, category,\nsubcategory, key, pieces, withAi): Map
  }
  class PublicInsights {
    ~feed(Filters): List<Insight>
    ~search(Filters): List<Insight>
  }
}

package "fai-application · ports" {
  interface SearchIndexPort <<port>> {
    +enabled(): boolean
    +search(index, term, filters, limit): List<UUID>
  }
  interface TimelineProjectionPort <<port>> {
    +enabled(): boolean
    +readTimeline(userId, limit): List<UUID>
  }
}

package "fai-application · hype" {
  class HypeScoreConfig {
    +algorithmVersion(): String = HYPE_V2
    +levelThresholds(): int[] = 20,40,60,75,90
    +staleAfterHours(): int = 24
  }
}

Scheme "*" --> "1" User : user
SchemeItem "*" --> "1" Scheme : scheme
SchemeItem "*" --> "1" WardrobeItem : wardrobeItem
WardrobeItem "*" --> "1" User : user
Follow "*" --> "1" User : follower
Follow "*" --> "1" User : following
StyleDna "1" --> "1" User : user
Share "*" --> "1" User : user
Scheme --> SchemeStatus
Scheme --> Visibility
WardrobeItem --> ModerationStatus
Follow --> FollowStatus
HypeScoreCurrent --> HypeLevel
HypeScoreCurrent ..> Scheme : entityId (SCHEME)
HypeScoreCurrent ..> WardrobeItem : entityId (PIECE)

SearchService ..> Filters
SearchService ..> Cursor
SearchService --> SchemeService : canView · view
SearchService --> Guard : canView (peças)
SearchService ..> Follow : bloqueados / seguindo
SearchService ..> StyleDna : afinidade
SearchService ..> Share : COMPARTILHADO (runway)
SearchService ..> HypeScoreCurrent : relevância, filtro, "Em alta"
SearchService ..> HypeScoreConfig
SearchService ..> SearchIndexPort : termo (opcional)
SearchService ..> TimelineProjectionPort : runway (opcional)
SchemeService --> Guard
InsightService --> PublicInsights
InsightService ..> InsightContext
PublicInsights ..> HypeScoreCurrent : só public_eligible

note bottom of HypeScoreCurrent
  publicEligible = PUBLIC (+ PUBLISHED no look),
  perfil não PRIVATE, peça APPROVED e conta fora
  do modo de teste. Só esse Hype ordena e filtra
  em contexto de terceiros (sem ele = neutro 0,5 no
  feed e fora do filtro hypeLevel — nunca 0).
end note
note right of Filters : hypeLevel é FILTRO de faixa mínima,\nnunca aba nem ordenação
@enduml
